Vendored test fixtures: bidask
==============================

ohlc_2000.csv.gz and ohlc-miss_2000.csv.gz are the first 2000 data rows (plus
header) of pseudocode/ohlc.csv and pseudocode/ohlc-miss.csv from
https://github.com/eguidotti/bidask (read 2026-09-29), gzipped without
modification. edge_reference_values.json holds values computed from them by the
bidask 2.1.0 Python package (bidask.edge, sign=True); see its "provenance" key.

They are test data only: nothing under panelary/ reads them, and no bidask code
is copied into Panelary. They are redistributed under the MIT License of the
bidask project, reproduced below.

